Photo slots (currently brand-styled placeholders)
-------------------------------------------------
The images in assets/img/ are temporary, on-brand placeholder graphics generated
for this build. They are NOT photographs and need no attribution. Replace any of
them with your own photo (or a royalty-free one) by OVERWRITING the file with the
SAME name — no code changes needed.

Slot               File                              Suggested royalty-free search
-----------------  --------------------------------  ----------------------------------------
Hero background    assets/img/hero.webp(+.jpg)       "container ship port" / "shipping containers aerial"
Sea freight        assets/img/sea-fcl.webp(+.jpg)    "shipping containers" / "container terminal"
Road freight       assets/img/road.webp(+.jpg)       "freight truck highway"
Air freight        assets/img/air.webp(+.jpg)        "cargo airplane loading" / "air cargo"
Air Charter        assets/img/air-charter.webp(+.jpg)"cargo aircraft tarmac"
OBC                assets/img/obc.webp(+.jpg)         "courier airport" / "business traveler airport"
Customs            assets/img/customs.webp(+.jpg)     "customs warehouse" / "logistics paperwork"
Door-to-door       assets/img/door-to-door.webp(+.jpg)"warehouse logistics" / "delivery van"
Coverage           assets/img/coverage.webp(+.jpg)    "world map logistics" / "global shipping"
About              assets/img/about.webp(+.jpg)       "logistics team" / "warehouse"

Where to get royalty-free, commercial-use photos:
  - Unsplash  https://unsplash.com/  (Unsplash License — free for commercial use, attribution appreciated)
  - Pexels    https://www.pexels.com/ (Pexels License — free for commercial use)

If you use a photo that requests attribution, add a line here, e.g.:
  assets/img/hero.webp — Photo by <Author> on Unsplash (<url>)

Toggle the little filename tags shown on each slot by setting
SHOW_IMAGE_SLOT_LABELS = false near the top of assets/js/main.js.
